## New Test Creation Checklist

**Follow this mandatory order:**

- [ ] Create spec in `cypress/e2e/...`
- [ ] Create Page Objects/Locators (if necessary)
- [ ] **Add to `specPattern` in `cypress.config.js`** (MANDATORY)
- [ ] **Create documentation in `docs/cases/architecture-<nome>.md`** (MANDATORY)
- [ ] **Update `docs/testes.md`** (MANDATORY)
- [ ] Apply tags in `describe` for filtering (`@cypress/grep`). **See [ADR-0010](../docs/adr/0010-use-tags-for-test-filtering.md)**

**IMPORTANT**: Do not consider the test complete until all items above are finalized.

